# CareSetu daily backup cron (PHASE-1 T8b, #32).
#
# Install on the staging VM:
#   crontab deploy/cron/caresetu-backup.cron
#
# The crontab format does not interpolate variables into the command line, so
# the checkout path is written literally below. The staging VM convention is a
# checkout at /opt/caresetu (the Caddyfile edge is run from the same checkout);
# adjust the path if it differs.
#
# The backup script refuses to run without credentials and a passphrase, so the
# operator must add a connection env block above the schedule line (values
# belong to the VM, never this repo - security-phii-standards.md §4). Example:
#
#   PGHOST=localhost
#   PGPORT=5432
#   PGDATABASE=caresetu
#   PGUSER=caresetu
#   PGPASSWORD=<from the secret manager>
#   BACKUP_PASSPHRASE=<from the secret manager>
#
# Runs every day at 01:30 local time. Daily cadence keeps the recovery point
# objective (RPO) <= 24 h - the NFR-004 durability floor. Dumps land encrypted
# at rest in the script's BACKUP_DIR (default /var/backups/caresetu) and are
# pruned after BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS (default 14).

30 1 * * * /opt/caresetu/deploy/cron/backup.sh >> /var/log/caresetu/backup.log 2>&1
